      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RIGATONI MONELLI (1) has mixed form a little and missed the frame the last two but was a Grade 4/5 winner three back (22.69) at this track over 400m. Better than last run and makes appeal this time. BRAVE ANNIE (2) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (22.67) at this track behind My Paddy Boy in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expected to feature. SHEERAN MELODY (3) found traffic in the run and collided, missing the frame when a 7 length fourth (22.56) at this track in a OPEN. Can do much better this time. REIKO BOOM (4) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to bounce back.",
